      "id": "bd9d31db-8182-4eea-b5f8-133fae779401",
      "name": "Use Cases > Spotlight Ad",
      "description": {
        "content": "Spotlight Ads allow you to showcase your product, service, event, content, and more. Upon clicking your Ad, you navigate to the website or landing page of your choice. Learn more about [Spotlight Ads](https://www.linkedin.com/help/lms/answer/a420806).\n\n##",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
